• Experience working on research or evaluation projects for federal, state, or local agencies or other public or nonprofit entities. &nbsp;

• Experience with co-authoring systematic review, scoping reviews or other rigorous evidence syntheses using written protocols.

• Familiarity with knowledge translation theory and practice.&nbsp;

• Familiarity with producing 508-compliant documents. &nbsp;

